<h3>Walkways and Garden Paths</h3>
<p>Guiding movement through the property is essential. Well-placed path lighting improves navigation and creates a warm, inviting atmosphere from the curb to the door and from the patio to the garden.</p>

<h3>Trees and Large Plantings</h3>
<p>Mature trees are among the most valuable features on many properties, and among the most dramatic lighting opportunities. A broad live oak can take three or four fixtures to light well; a slender crape myrtle may need one or two. Our <a href="/services/garden-tree-lighting/">garden and tree lighting</a> service and our guide to <a href="/how-to-light-live-oak-trees/">lighting live oak trees</a> go deeper.</p>
