<h2>What Does Landscape Lighting Cost in Texas?</h2>
<p>Most residential projects run <strong>$2,500 to $12,000</strong>. A starter package for a front elevation and walk typically falls between $2,500 and $5,000, while full estate designs can exceed $20,000. Professionally installed fixtures generally average about <strong>$250–$450 each</strong>, including their share of the transformer, cable, labor and aiming. These are planning ranges; your site, fixture grade and controls determine the final number.</p>
