<h2>Professional Installation vs DIY Landscape Lighting</h2>
<p>Whether professional installation is worth it depends on the project's complexity and the results you want.</p>
<h3>Benefits of Professional Installation</h3>
<p>Professionals bring custom design planning, proper beam angle selection, voltage calculations, precise fixture positioning and long-term reliability. Experienced designers know how light behaves at night and anticipate problems before installation begins.</p>
<h3>Benefits of DIY Installation</h3>
<p>DIY kits offer lower upfront cost, simpler installation and the flexibility to expand gradually. For small projects, such as a garden path, a flower bed accent or deck lights, DIY can work well.</p>
